<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Best Invoicing Software for Freelancers in 2026 | StackGuide</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700;1,400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

    :root {
      --bg: #F8F9FA;
      --surface: #ffffff;
      --border: #E9ECEF;
      --text: #1a1a2e;
      --muted: #6B7280;
      --accent: #2563EB;
      --accent-light: #EFF6FF;
      --accent-border: #BFDBFE;
      --green: #16A34A;
      --green-light: #F0FDF4;
      --red: #DC2626;
      --red-light: #FFF5F5;
      --gold: #F59E0B;
      --badge-bg: #F1F5F9;
      --badge-text: #475569;
    }

    body {
      font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif;
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    /* ── Layout ── */
    .page { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 2.5rem 1.25rem 6rem; }

    /* ── Article header ── */
    .article-header {
      margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
      padding-bottom: 2rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .eyebrow {
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--accent);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
    }

    .eyebrow::before {
      content: '';
      display: inline-block;
      width: 18px;
      height: 2px;
      background: var(--accent);
      border-radius: 2px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 4vw, 2.1rem);
      font-weight: 700;
      line-height: 1.15;
      color: var(--text);
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }

    .lede {
      font-size: 1rem;
      color: #4B5563;
      line-height: 1.7;
      max-width: 62ch;
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    }

    .article-meta {
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .meta-dot { color: var(--border); }

    .meta-tag {
      background: var(--badge-bg);
      color: var(--badge-text);
      border-radius: 4px;
      padding: 0.15rem 0.5rem;
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    /* ── Bottom line box ── */
    .bottom-line {
      background: var(--accent-light);
      border: 1px solid var(--accent-border);
      border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
      border-radius: 6px;
      padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
      margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      color: #1E40AF;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .bottom-line strong { font-weight: 600; }

    /* ── Section headings ── */
    .section-label {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--text);
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    }

    /* ── Quick picks table ── */
    .quick-picks { margin-bottom: 2.5rem; }

    .table-wrap {
      overflow-x: auto;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 8px;
      background: var(--surface);
    }

    table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    thead th {
      background: #F8FAFC;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--muted);
      text-align: left;
      padding: 0.6rem 1rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    }

    tbody td {
      padding: 0.65rem 1rem;
      color: #374151;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #F3F4F6;
      vertical-align: middle;
    }

    tbody tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }

    tbody tr:hover td { background: #FAFBFC; }

    table a {
      color: var(--accent);
      font-weight: 600;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    table a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

    .tag-yes { color: var(--green); font-weight: 600; }
    .tag-no  { color: var(--muted); }

    /* ── Tool cards ── */
    .tools-list { margin-bottom: 2rem; }

    .tool-card {
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 10px;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .tool-card:hover { border-color: #CBD5E1; }

    .card-top {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: flex-start;
      padding: 1.25rem 1.25rem 1rem;
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    .card-left { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }

    .card-rank {
      font-size: 0.68rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--muted);
      margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    }

    .card-name-row {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
    }

    .card-name {
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--text);
      line-height: 1.2;
    }

    .card-badge {
      font-size: 0.65rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      background: var(--accent-light);
      color: var(--accent);
      border: 1px solid var(--accent-border);
      border-radius: 4px;
      padding: 0.12rem 0.45rem;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .card-tagline {
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      color: #4B5563;
      line-height: 1.45;
    }

    .card-right {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-end;
      gap: 0.45rem;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .stars {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 1px;
      line-height: 1;
    }

    .star-full  { color: var(--gold); font-size: 0.95rem; }
    .star-half  { color: var(--gold); font-size: 0.95rem; opacity: 0.45; }
    .star-empty { color: #D1D5DB; font-size: 0.95rem; }

    .rating-num {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #374151;
      margin-left: 0.25rem;
    }

    .price-chip {
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      background: var(--badge-bg);
      color: var(--badge-text);
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: 0.2rem 0.65rem;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    /* Pros / cons */
    .card-body {
      padding: 0 1.25rem 0;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .pros-cons {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 1rem;
      padding: 1rem 0;
    }

    .pc-label {
      font-size: 0.62rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.07em;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    .pros-col .pc-label { color: var(--green); }
    .cons-col .pc-label { color: var(--red); }

    .pros-cons ul {
      list-style: none;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.35rem;
    }

    .pros-cons li {
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: #374151;
      padding-left: 1.1rem;
      position: relative;
      line-height: 1.4;
    }

    .pros-col li::before {
      content: '✓';
      position: absolute;
      left: 0;
      color: var(--green);
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 0.72rem;
    }

    .cons-col li::before {
      content: '✕';
      position: absolute;
      left: 0;
      color: var(--red);
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 0.72rem;
    }

    /* Read more — CSS only via <details> */
    .read-more {
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .read-more summary {
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--accent);
      padding: 0.7rem 1.25rem;
      cursor: pointer;
      list-style: none;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.4rem;
      user-select: none;
    }

    .read-more summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }

    .read-more summary::before {
      content: '▸';
      font-size: 0.65rem;
      transition: transform 0.15s;
      display: inline-block;
    }

    .read-more[open] summary::before { transform: rotate(90deg); }

    .read-more[open] summary { color: #1E40AF; }

    .review-text {
      padding: 0 1.25rem 1.25rem;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: #374151;
      line-height: 1.7;
      max-width: 64ch;
    }

    .review-text p { margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
    .review-text p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
    .review-text strong { color: var(--text); font-weight: 600; }

    /* ── Editorial sections ── */
    .editorial {
      padding-top: 2rem;
      margin-top: 2rem;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }

    .editorial p {
      font-size: 0.88rem;
      color: #374151;
      line-height: 1.7;
      max-width: 64ch;
      margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
    }

    .editorial p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }

    /* ── Decision grid ── */
    .decision-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 0.75rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    }

    .decision-card {
      background: #F8FAFC;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 0.9rem 1rem;
    }

    .decision-q {
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--text);
      margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
      line-height: 1.35;
    }

    .decision-a {
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: #4B5563;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .callout {
      background: var(--accent-light);
      border: 1px solid var(--accent-border);
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 0.85rem 1rem;
      font-size: 0.83rem;
      color: #1E40AF;
      line-height: 1.55;
    }

    .callout a { color: #1E40AF; font-weight: 600; }

    /* ── FAQ ── */
    .faq-list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.5rem; }

    .faq-item {
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 8px;
      background: var(--surface);
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .faq-item summary {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--text);
      padding: 0.9rem 1rem;
      cursor: pointer;
      list-style: none;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
    }

    .faq-item summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }

    .faq-item summary::after {
      content: '+';
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-weight: 400;
      color: var(--muted);
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .faq-item[open] summary::after { content: '−'; }
    .faq-item[open] summary { color: var(--accent); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }

    .faq-item p {
      padding: 0.85rem 1rem;
      font-size: 0.83rem;
      color: #4B5563;
      line-height: 1.65;
      max-width: 64ch;
    }

    /* ── Mobile ── */
    @media (max-width: 580px) {
      .card-top { flex-direction: column; gap: 0.75rem; }
      .card-right { flex-direction: row; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; width: 100%; }
      .pros-cons { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .decision-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }

    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      .read-more summary::before { transition: none; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<main class="page">
<article>

  <!-- ── Header ── -->
  <header class="article-header">
    <p class="eyebrow">Invoicing Software · Updated September 2026</p>
    <h1>Best Invoicing Software for Freelancers in 2026</h1>
    <p class="lede">Most freelancers send their first invoice as a Word doc cobbled together in Canva. By client three or four, you're chasing payments manually and spending Sunday evenings on admin that should take ten minutes. We tested seven tools on ease of setup, automation, pricing, and time tracking.</p>
    <div class="article-meta">
      <span class="meta-tag">7 tools reviewed</span>
      <span class="meta-dot">·</span>
      <span>Pricing verified Sep 2026</span>
      <span class="meta-dot">·</span>
      <a href="/affiliate-disclosure/" style="color:var(--muted);">Affiliate disclosure</a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- ── Bottom line ── -->
  <div class="bottom-line">
    <strong>Bottom line:</strong> FreshBooks is the best all-round pick for most freelancers. Wave is the best free option. Xero is the strongest choice if you work with an accountant, bill international clients, or are based in Europe.
  </div>

  <!-- ── Quick picks ── -->
  <section class="quick-picks">
    <p class="section-label">Quick picks</p>
    <div class="table-wrap">
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Tool</th>
            <th>Best for</th>
            <th>Free plan</th>
            <th>From</th>
            <th>Time tracking</th>
            <th>Multi-currency</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td><a href="#freshbooks">FreshBooks</a></td><td>Best overall</td><td class="tag-no">No (30-day trial)</td><td>$23/mo</td><td class="tag-yes">Yes</td><td class="tag-yes">Yes</td></tr>
          <tr><td><a href="#wave">Wave</a></td><td>Best free invoicing</td><td class="tag-yes">Yes (unlimited)</td><td>Free</td><td class="tag-no">No</td><td class="tag-no">No</td></tr>
          <tr><td><a href="#xero">Xero</a></td><td>Best for Europe / accountants</td><td class="tag-no">No</td><td>$25/mo</td><td class="tag-no">No</td><td class="tag-yes">Yes</td></tr>
          <tr><td><a href="#zoho">Zoho Invoice</a></td><td>Best free with automation</td><td class="tag-yes">Yes (1,000/yr)</td><td>Free</td><td class="tag-yes">Yes</td><td class="tag-yes">Yes</td></tr>
          <tr><td><a href="#bonsai">Bonsai</a></td><td>Best all-in-one</td><td class="tag-no">No (7-day trial)</td><td>$19/user/mo</td><td class="tag-yes">Yes</td><td class="tag-no">No</td></tr>
          <tr><td><a href="#harvest">Harvest</a></td><td>Best for hourly billers</td><td class="tag-yes">Yes (1 seat)</td><td>$9/seat/mo</td><td class="tag-yes">Yes</td><td class="tag-no">No</td></tr>
          <tr><td><a href="#quickbooks">QuickBooks</a></td><td>Best for US tax prep</td><td class="tag-no">No</td><td>$20/mo</td><td class="tag-no">No</td><td class="tag-no">No</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ── Tool cards ── -->
  <section class="tools-list">
    <p class="section-label">The 7 best invoicing tools for freelancers</p>

    <!-- FreshBooks -->
    <div class="tool-card" id="freshbooks">
      <div class="card-top">
        <div class="card-left">
          <p class="card-rank">#1</p>
          <div class="card-name-row">
            <span class="card-name">FreshBooks</span>
            <span class="card-badge">Best overall</span>
          </div>
          <p class="card-tagline">The cleanest invoicing experience for most freelancers.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card-right">
          <div class="stars" aria-label="4.5 out of 5">
            <span class="star-full">★</span><span class="star-full">★</span><span class="star-full">★</span><span class="star-full">★</span><span class="star-half">★</span>
            <span class="rating-num">4.5</span>
          </div>
          <div class="price-chip">From $23/mo</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="card-body">
        <div class="pros-cons">
          <div class="pros-col"><p class="pc-label">Pros</p><ul>
            <li>Best-in-class ease of use</li>
            <li>Automatic late payment reminders</li>
            <li>Recurring invoices and late fees</li>
            <li>Solid mobile app</li>
            <li>30-day free trial</li>
          </ul></div>
          <div class="cons-col"><p class="pc-label">Cons</p><ul>
            <li>5-client cap on cheapest plan</li>
            <li>No free plan</li>
            <li>$11/mo per extra team member</li>
            <li>FreshBooks branding on lower plans</li>
          </ul></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <details class="read-more">
        <summary>Read full review</summary>
        <div class="review-text">
          <p>FreshBooks started as a freelance invoicing tool and has never lost that focus. The interface is cleaner than QuickBooks, the mobile app is genuinely usable on the go, and the automation handles the parts of invoicing most freelancers hate: payment reminders, recurring invoices, and late fees all run without you touching anything.</p>
          <p><strong>Pricing:</strong> Lite $23/mo (5 clients) · Plus $43/mo (50 clients) · Premium $70/mo (unlimited). FreshBooks frequently runs 70–90% off for the first three months — check the pricing page before signing up.</p>
          <p><strong>The catch:</strong> The 5-client cap on Lite is stingy. Six active clients pushes you straight to the $43 tier. Each extra team member costs $11/month on top.</p>
          <p><strong>Skip it if:</strong> You have fewer than three clients and a zero budget — Wave covers basic invoicing for free.</p>
        </div>
      </details>
    </div>

    <!-- Wave -->
    <div class="tool-card" id="wave">
      <div class="card-top">
        <div class="card-left">
          <p class="card-rank">#2</p>
          <div class="card-name-row">
            <span class="card-name">Wave</span>
            <span class="card-badge">Best free</span>
          </div>
          <p class="card-tagline">Genuinely free invoicing with real accounting built in.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card-right">
          <div class="stars" aria-label="4 out of 5">
            <span class="star-full">★</span><span class="star-full">★</span><span class="star-full">★</span><span class="star-full">★</span><span class="star-empty">★</span>
            <span class="rating-num">4.0</span>
          </div>
          <div class="price-chip">Free / $19/mo Pro</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="card-body">
        <div class="pros-cons">
          <div class="pros-col"><p class="pc-label">Pros</p><ul>
            <li>Unlimited invoices and clients</li>
            <li>Real double-entry accounting</li>
            <li>No trial timer — free forever</li>
            <li>Receipt scanning included</li>
          </ul></div>
          <div class="cons-col"><p class="pc-label">Cons</p><ul>
            <li>2.9% + $0.60 payment processing fee</li>
            <li>No native time tracking</li>
            <li>Chatbot support only on free plan</li>
            <li>No recurring billing on free plan</li>
          </ul></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <details class="read-more">
        <summary>Read full review</summary>
        <div class="review-text">
          <p>Wave is the rare free product that doesn't feel like a trap. The Starter plan gives you unlimited invoices, unlimited clients, and genuine double-entry bookkeeping — with no trial timer. For a freelancer who gets paid by bank transfer, Wave costs nothing to run.</p>
          <p><strong>Pricing:</strong> Starter free · Pro $19/mo (automated bank imports, recurring billing, priority support).</p>
          <p><strong>The catch:</strong> Payment processing costs 2.9% + $0.60 per transaction — for a freelancer billing $3,000/month online, that's $1,044/year in fees.</p>
          <p><strong>Skip it if:</strong> You bill by the hour, need time tracking, or want a human to call when something goes wrong.</p>
        </div>
      </details>
    </div>

    <!-- Xero -->
    <div class="tool-card" id="xero">
      <div class="card-top">
        <div class="card-left">
          <p class="card-rank">#3</p>
          <div class="card-name-row">
            <span class="card-name">Xero</span>
            <span class="card-badge">Best for Europe</span>
          </div>
          <p class="card-tagline">Full accounting depth with VAT compliance and multi-currency.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card-right">
          <div class="stars" aria-label="4 out of 5">
            <span class="star-full">★</span><span class="star-full">★</span><span class="star-full">★</span><span class="star-full">★</span><span class="star-empty">★</span>
            <span class="rating-num">4.0</span>
          </div>
          <div class="price-chip">From $25/mo</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="card-body">
        <div class="pros-cons">
          <div class="pros-col"><p class="pc-label">Pros</p><ul>
            <li>Peppol e-invoicing for EU compliance</li>
            <li>VAT return preparation</li>
            <li>Accountant collaboration built in</li>
            <li>1,000+ app integrations</li>
          </ul></div>
          <div class="cons-col"><p class="pc-label">Cons</p><ul>
            <li>No free plan</li>
            <li>20 invoice/month cap on cheapest plan</li>
            <li>Steeper learning curve</li>
            <li>Multi-currency gated behind $90/mo</li>
          </ul></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <details class="read-more">
        <summary>Read full review</summary>
        <div class="review-text">
          <p>Xero is accounting software that happens to be excellent at invoicing. If you work with an accountant, Xero is the tool they're most likely to already use — you give them access and they handle your books without needing to export anything.</p>
          <p><strong>Pricing:</strong> Early $25/mo (20 invoices) · Growing $55/mo (unlimited) · Established $90/mo (multi-currency, expenses, projects). Currently running 90% off for the first 6 months — check their pricing page.</p>
          <p><strong>The catch:</strong> More than most solo freelancers need. The cheapest plan caps invoices, and multi-currency is gated behind the most expensive tier.</p>
          <p><strong>Skip it if:</strong> You just need clean, fast invoicing in one currency — FreshBooks or Wave will serve you better.</p>
        </div>
      </details>
    </div>

    <!-- Zoho Invoice -->
    <div class="tool-card" id="zoho">
      <div class="card-top">
        <div class="card-left">
          <p class="card-rank">#4</p>
          <div class="card-name-row">
            <span class="card-name">Zoho Invoice</span>
            <span class="card-badge">Best free with automation</span>
          </div>
          <p class="card-tagline">The most feature-rich free invoicing tool available.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card-right">
          <div class="stars" aria-label="4 out of 5">
            <span class="star-full">★</span><span class="star-full">★</span><span class="star-full">★</span><span class="star-full">★</span><span class="star-empty">★</span>
            <span class="rating-num">4.0</span>
