      <details class="read-more">
        <summary>Read full review</summary>
        <div class="review-text">
          <p>Zoho Invoice is permanently free for core invoicing — not a trial, not a freemium bait-and-switch. You get up to 1,000 invoices per year, recurring billing, automatic payment reminders, a client portal, and multi-currency support at no cost.</p>
          <p><strong>Pricing:</strong> Free. If you need the broader accounting suite, Zoho Books starts at $15/mo.</p>
          <p><strong>The catch:</strong> The interface feels busier than FreshBooks. Works best if you're already in the Zoho ecosystem.</p>
          <p><strong>Skip it if:</strong> You want the cleanest possible UX or need deep accounting integration.</p>
        </div>
