        <div class="review-text">
          <p>Bonsai is built around the full client lifecycle: proposals, contracts, project management, time tracking, invoicing, and expense tracking in one platform. If you're tired of stitching together five separate tools, Bonsai is worth the premium.</p>
          <p><strong>Pricing:</strong> Basic $9/user/mo (no invoicing) · Essentials $19/user/mo (invoices + proposals + contracts) · Premium $29/user/mo · Elite $49/user/mo. All billed annually.</p>
